---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PromptPage from "../../../components/PromptPage.astro";

const masterPrompt = `Act as an experienced visual art director, photographer and AI image prompt engineer.

TASK:
Create a production-ready AI image-generation prompt based on the information below.

IMAGE GOAL:
[What should the image communicate, show or achieve?]

IMAGE TYPE:
[Example: product image, portrait, food image, social media visual, advertisement, thumbnail, editorial image, lifestyle scene.]

MAIN SUBJECT:
[Describe the main person, product, object, animal or scene.]

SUBJECT DETAILS TO PRESERVE:
[Appearance, clothing, colours, shape, proportions, product packaging, facial identity or other critical details.]

ENVIRONMENT / LOCATION:
[Describe the setting, background, time of day, weather and surrounding elements.]

COMPOSITION:
[Example: centered, rule of thirds, subject on left with text space on right, close-up hero composition.]

CAMERA ANGLE:
[Example: eye level, low angle, high angle, overhead, 45-degree angle.]

SHOT TYPE:
[Example: extreme close-up, close-up, medium shot, full body, wide shot.]

LENS / PHOTOGRAPHIC FEEL:
[Example: 35mm cinematic, 50mm natural, 85mm portrait, macro photography.]

LIGHTING:
[Example: soft window light, dramatic side lighting, golden-hour light, premium studio lighting.]

VISUAL STYLE:
[Example: photorealistic, cinematic, editorial, luxury commercial, documentary, minimalist.]

MOOD:
[Example: warm, confident, premium, energetic, calm, dramatic.]

COLOUR DIRECTION:
[Describe the desired palette or colour grading.]

BACKGROUND DETAILS:
[Describe surfaces, props, depth, blur, architecture or environmental elements.]

DEPTH OF FIELD:
[Example: shallow depth of field, deep focus, softly blurred background.]

POSE / ACTION:
[If relevant, explain what the subject is doing.]

TEXT SPACE:
[Describe where clean negative space is needed for later typography, or state "none".]

ASPECT RATIO:
[Example: 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 16:9.]

PLATFORM / PURPOSE:
[Example: Facebook post, Instagram Reel cover, LinkedIn graphic, website hero, advertisement.]

REFERENCE IMAGE REQUIREMENTS:
[If reference images are used, state exactly what must remain consistent.]

TEXT / LOGO REQUIREMENTS:
[Specify whether visible text or logos are required, allowed or should be avoided.]

SPECIAL REQUIREMENTS:
[List any additional visual or technical instructions.]

NEGATIVE CONSTRAINTS:
[List anything that should not appear or change.]

RESPONSE REQUIREMENTS:

1. SUBJECT ACCURACY
- Preserve the requested identity, appearance, proportions, colours and important visual details.
- Do not redesign products, clothing, packaging or characters unless explicitly requested.
- Do not add unrelated accessories or objects.

2. COMPOSITION
- Make the intended subject the clear focal point.
- Follow the requested subject placement and framing.
- Keep important elements inside safe margins for the requested platform.
- Preserve clean negative space where text will be added later.

3. CAMERA
- Use the requested angle, shot type and lens feel.
- Keep perspective realistic.
- Avoid excessive wide-angle distortion unless specifically requested.

4. LIGHTING
- Describe a clear lighting direction.
- Use realistic shadows, highlights and reflections.
- Match the lighting to the mood and environment.

5. MATERIAL & TEXTURE REALISM
- Preserve realistic skin, fabric, metal, glass, wood, food, packaging or other relevant materials.
- Avoid plastic-looking textures and excessive smoothing.

6. ENVIRONMENT
- Make the background visually support the subject.
- Avoid unnecessary clutter.
- Keep environmental details coherent with the location and lighting.

7. REFERENCE CONSISTENCY
If a reference image is provided:
- preserve critical identity characteristics
- preserve product shape and branding when requested
- preserve clothing, hairstyle, colour and proportions where required
- do not make unnecessary stylistic changes

8. TEXT & LOGOS
- Do not invent random text, labels, logos or watermarks.
- If typography will be added later, create clean visual space instead.
- If exact visible text is required, clearly state it in the final prompt.

9. NEGATIVE CONTROL
Prevent common image-generation problems such as:
- distorted anatomy
- extra fingers or limbs
- warped products
- duplicate objects
- inconsistent reflections
- floating props
- random text
- unwanted logos
- cluttered backgrounds
- incorrect proportions

10. IMAGE QUALITY
Aim for:
- strong subject separation
- believable lighting
- accurate proportions
- natural textures
- controlled highlights
- realistic shadows
- coherent depth
- premium finished-image quality

OUTPUT FORMAT:

1. Final AI Image Prompt
2. Composition
3. Camera & Lens
4. Lighting
5. Style & Colour
6. Subject / Reference Consistency
7. Background & Environment
8. Negative Constraints

The Final AI Image Prompt should be written as one polished block that can be copied directly into an AI image-generation model.`;

const steps = [
  {
    title: "Define the visual goal",
    description:
      "Explain what the image is for before describing style. A product ad, thumbnail and editorial portrait require different composition decisions.",
  },
  {
    title: "Lock critical subject details",
    description:
      "Specify the identity, product shape, clothing, colours or other details that must not change.",
  },
  {
    title: "Direct the camera and light",
    description:
      "Choose the framing, viewing angle and lighting direction instead of relying only on broad words such as cinematic or premium.",
  },
  {
    title: "Control unwanted changes",
    description:
      "Use negative constraints to reduce random text, distorted anatomy, extra objects, warped products and clutter.",
  },
];

const example = {
  input: [
    "Image type: Premium LinkedIn promotional graphic.",
    "Subject: Laptop showing an inventory dashboard.",
    "Composition: Laptop on the left, clean text space on the right.",
    "Environment: Modern dark workspace.",
    "Camera: Eye-level three-quarter view.",
    "Lighting: Soft premium studio lighting.",
    "Style: Photorealistic business-software advertising.",
    "Colours: Deep navy with subtle electric-lime accents.",
    "Aspect ratio: 1:1.",
    "Text: Do not generate visible text inside the image.",
  ],

  output: [
    "Create a photorealistic premium business-software advertising image in a square 1:1 composition. Position a modern laptop prominently on the left side of a sophisticated dark workspace, viewed from a clean eye-level three-quarter angle.",
    "The laptop displays a believable inventory-management dashboard with structured charts and tables but no readable generated text. Preserve generous uncluttered negative space on the right side for later typography.",
    "Use soft controlled studio lighting, realistic screen reflections, subtle depth of field and a deep navy visual palette with restrained electric-lime accents. Keep the environment minimal, professional and suitable for a modern SaaS brand.",
  ],
};

const tips = [
  {
    title: "Describe structure before style",
    description:
      "Subject placement, framing and lighting usually matter more than adding many style adjectives.",
  },
  {
    title: "Leave text for design tools",
    description:
      "When exact typography matters, generate clean text space and add the wording afterward instead of relying on the image model to render it correctly.",
  },
  {
    title: "Repeat identity constraints",
    description:
      "When consistency matters across several images, repeat the critical appearance, clothing, product and colour details in every prompt.",
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI Image Prompt Builder | KRIYANO"
  description="Create structured AI image prompts with clear subject, composition, camera, lighting, style, reference consistency and negative constraints."
>
  <PromptPage
    category="IMAGE GENERATION"
    title="AI Image"
    accentTitle="Prompt Builder."
    description="Turn a rough image idea into structured production-ready instructions for subject, composition, camera, lighting, style and visual consistency."
    meta={[
      "Free prompt",
      "Image generation",
      "General purpose",
    ]}
    bestFor={[
      "Social media visuals",
      "Product images",
      "Portraits",
      "Advertisements",
      "Thumbnails",
      "Website graphics",
    ]}
    masterPrompt={masterPrompt}
    introTitle="Direct the image instead of describing a mood."
    introDescription="Start with the purpose and subject, then control composition, camera, lighting and constraints. This produces more predictable prompts than stacking vague style words."
    steps={steps}
    exampleTitle="From simple idea to directed image."
    example={example}
    tipsTitle="Get more controlled image generations."
    tips={tips}
    sidebarTitle="Need a more specialized image prompt?"
    sidebarDescription="Explore KRIYANO's Product Photography and Food Photography prompts when you need deeper control for those specific image types."
    warningTitle="Reference consistency"
    warningText="AI image models can still alter faces, products, clothing, proportions and small details. When accuracy matters, compare each result with the reference and repeat the critical consistency requirements."
  />
</BaseLayout>